# A FAT whose chain leaves the volume: B:\MANY's first cluster points to a
# reserved value. dir lists the first cluster, then stops.
program: shell
media: B damaged
keys: dir b:\\many\n
match: contains
timeout: 60
emulators: bochs mame
---
A:\>dir b:\many
 Directory of B:\MANY
FILE30   TXT        29  1989-01-01  00:00
Damaged FAT on drive B
A:\>
